`analyzeImpact` accepts three root types: `fact | entity | causal_event` (`impact.ts:38`). The service, MCP tool (`analyze_blast_radius`), HTTP endpoint (`/api/impact/:type/:id`), and tests all fully support all three roots — including `fact`, which is the most common target of agent-initiated destructive actions (`expire_fact` / `invalidate_fact`).

The viz exposes the impact subpanel for two of the three: `entity` and `causal_event`. Fact roots get no subpanel.

## Falsifying test

